<title>DENMARK: Rieber says raises Phoenix bid.</title>
<headline>Rieber says raises Phoenix bid.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Rieber and Son on Friday raised its bid for Denmark's Phoenix Contractors to 740 Danish crowns per A-share and 665 crowns per C-share, managing director Olav Daviknes told Reuters.</p>
</text>
